          "comment": "# Comfy Capybara- Image Edit\n\nUpload an image or video and input a text instruction. Generate an edited output using the Capybara model for tasks like style changes, object replacement, or time-of-day adjustments. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs a COMFY_API_KEY.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/Image_capybara_v0_1_image_edit.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
